    {
      "source": "Invokes the find-all method of the underlying repository using the method taking a <a href=\"../domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a> as parameter if\navailable (i.e. the equivalent to\n<a href=\"../repository/PagingAndSortingRepository.html#findAll(org.springframework.data.domain.Pageable)\"><code>PagingAndSortingRepository.findAll(Pageable)</code></a>), using the method taking\na <a href=\"../domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> if available (i.e. the equivalent to\n<a href=\"../repository/PagingAndSortingRepository.html#findAll(org.springframework.data.domain.Sort)\"><code>PagingAndSortingRepository.findAll(Sort)</code></a> by extracting the <a href=\"../domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a>\ncontained in the given <a href=\"../domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a>) or the plain equivalent to\n<a href=\"../repository/CrudRepository.html#findAll()\"><code>CrudRepository.findAll()</code></a>.",
      "translation": "使用底层存储库的 find-all 方法，如果存在接受 <a href=\"../domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a> 参数的方法（即等同于 <a href=\"../repository/PagingAndSortingRepository.html#findAll(org.springframework.data.domain.Pageable)\"><code>PagingAndSortingRepository.findAll(Pageable)</code></a>），则使用该方法的变体；如果存在接受 <a href=\"../domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> 的方法（即等同于从给定的 <a href=\"../domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a> 中提取其中包含的 <a href=\"../domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a>，然后调用 <a href=\"../repository/PagingAndSortingRepository.html#findAll(org.springframework.data.domain.Sort)\"><code>PagingAndSortingRepository.findAll(Sort)</code></a>），则使用该方法的变体；否则使用等同于 <a href=\"../repository/CrudRepository.html#findAll()\"><code>CrudRepository.findAll()</code></a> 的普通方法。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"QuerydslRepositoryInvokerAdapter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.querydsl\"><code>QuerydslRepositoryInvokerAdapter</code></a> for the given delegate <a href=\"../repository/support/RepositoryInvoker.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.support\"><code>RepositoryInvoker</code></a>,\n<a href=\"QuerydslPredicateExecutor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.querydsl\"><code>QuerydslPredicateExecutor</code></a> and Querydsl <code>Predicate</code>.",
      "translation": "为给定的委托 <a href=\"../repository/support/RepositoryInvoker.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.support\"><code>RepositoryInvoker</code></a>、<a href=\"QuerydslPredicateExecutor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.querydsl\"><code>QuerydslPredicateExecutor</code></a> 以及 Querydsl <code>Predicate</code> 创建一个新的 <a href=\"QuerydslRepositoryInvokerAdapter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.querydsl\"><code>QuerydslRepositoryInvokerAdapter</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Invokes the find-all method of the underlying repository using the method taking a <a href=\"../domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> as parameter if\navailable (i.e. the equivalent to\n<a href=\"../repository/PagingAndSortingRepository.html#findAll(org.springframework.data.domain.Sort)\"><code>PagingAndSortingRepository.findAll(Sort)</code></a>) or the plain equivalent to\n<a href=\"../repository/CrudRepository.html#findAll()\"><code>CrudRepository.findAll()</code></a>.",
      "translation": "使用底层存储库的 find-all 方法，如果可用则采用接受 <a href=\"../domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> 参数的方法（即等同于 <a href=\"../repository/PagingAndSortingRepository.html#findAll(org.springframework.data.domain.Sort)\"><code>PagingAndSortingRepository.findAll(Sort)</code></a>），否则采用简单的 <a href=\"../repository/CrudRepository.html#findAll()\"><code>CrudRepository.findAll()</code></a> 等效方法。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Invokes the query method backed by the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Method</code></a> using the given parameters, <a href=\"../domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a> and\n<a href=\"../domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a>.",
      "translation": "使用给定的参数、<a href=\"../domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a> 和 <a href=\"../domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a>，调用由给定<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Method</code></a> 支持的查询方法。",
      "count": 2
    },
