      "source": "<a href=\"../repository/support/RepositoryInvoker.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.support\"><code>RepositoryInvoker</code></a> that is aware of a <a href=\"QuerydslPredicateExecutor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.querydsl\"><code>QuerydslPredicateExecutor</code></a> and <code>Predicate</code> to be executed\nfor all flavors of <code>findAll(…)</code>. All other calls are forwarded to the configured delegate.",
